72fa2311\" href=\"?note=9fefe9c472fa2311\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism-category\">14-df-geometric-morphism-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\">\\(f:\\mathcal F\\to\\mathcal E\\)</span> 为几何态射；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\cong h\">\\(f\\cong h\\)</span> 指 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9fefe9c472fa2311\" href=\"?note=9fefe9c472fa2311\" title=\"14-df-geometric-morphism-category\">14-df-geometric-morphism-category</a> 的同一几何态射范畴中的对象同构，采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"d5f547b903550705\" href=\"?note=d5f547b903550705\" title=\"14-df-isomorphism\">14-df-isomorphism</a> 的可逆箭头条件；满射、嵌入、复合分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"9f240b2829f1b115\" href=\"?note=9f240b2829f1b115\" title=\"14-df-surjective-geometric-morphism\">14-df-surjective-geometric-morphism</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"98e8376f342f77c0\" href=\"?note=98e8376f342f77c0\" title=\"14-df-geometric-embedding\">14-df-geometric-embedding</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"a987285ba9cb0966\" href=\"?note=a987285ba9cb0966\" title=\"14-thm-composition-geometric-morphisms\">14-thm-composition-geometric-morphisms</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\mathcal G,s,e\\ \\bigl(\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}(s,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G)\\land\\mathrm{IsSurjection}(s)\\land\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}(e,\\mathcal G,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{IsEmbedding}(e)\\land \\mathrm{IsObjectIso}_{\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal E)}(f,s\\diamond e)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\mathcal G,s,e\\ \\bigl(\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}(s,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal G)\\land\\mathrm{IsSurjection}(s)\\land\\mathrm{IsGeometricMorphism}(e,\\mathcal G,\\mathcal E)\\land\\mathrm{IsEmbedding}(e)\\land \\mathrm{IsObjectIso}_{\\mathrm{Geom}(\\mathcal F,\\mathcal E)}(f,s\\diamond e)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 VII.4 的像分解。中间范畴取对应闭包拓扑的层子拓扑斯；伴随数据仅唯一到同构，故用几何态射同构而非任意所选伴随的严格等号。依 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"a987285ba9cb0966\" href=\"?note=a987285ba9cb0966\" title=\"14-thm-composition-geometric-morphisms\">14-thm-composition-geometric-morphisms</a>的参数约定，必须是 s⋄e，旧 e⋄s 无法类型检查。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9752b779c5f463f9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-surjective-geometric-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"9f240b2829f1b115","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-surjective-geometric-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-geometric-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"98e8376f342f77c0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-thm-composition-geometric-morphisms","status":"resolved","id":"a987285ba9cb0966","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-thm-composition-geometric-morphisms]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-geometric-morphism-category","status":"resolved","id":"9fefe9c472fa2311","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-geometric-morphism-category]]","embed":f